---
---

<section class="s services" id="services" style="--bg:var(--teal);--fg:var(--ivory)">
  <div class="pin">
    <p class="pin-head">What we do</p>
    <ol class="dots" aria-hidden="true">
      <li class="dot is-on">Software</li>
      <li class="dot">Telecalling</li>
      <li class="dot">Data</li>
      <li class="dot">Business process</li>
      <li class="dot">Healthcare</li>
    </ol>
    <div class="track">
      <article class="panel">
        <p class="pword" aria-hidden="true">Code</p>
        <div class="pbody">
          <h2>Software development</h2>
          <p>High-quality, user-friendly and scalable software built around your business &mdash; web platforms, mobile apps, internal tools and the automation that holds them together.</p>
          <ul class="tags"><li>Web</li><li>Mobile</li><li>Custom software</li><li>Automation</li></ul>
        </div>
      </article>
      <article class="panel">
        <p class="pword" aria-hidden="true">Voice</p>
        <div class="pbody">
          <h2>Telecalling services</h2>
          <p>Courteous, result-oriented conversations that strengthen relationships and turn interest into qualified leads &mdash; in the languages your customers speak.</p>
          <ul class="tags"><li>B2B campaigns</li><li>Lead generation</li><li>Multilingual</li><li>CRM</li></ul>
        </div>
      </article>
      <article class="panel">
        <p class="pword" aria-hidden="true">Data</p>
        <div class="pbody">
          <h2>Data entry &amp; management</h2>
          <p>Precise, timely data services that keep your records reliable and your decisions sharp, with documented checks at every step.</p>
          <ul class="tags"><li>Data entry</li><li>Quality assurance</li><li>Process design</li><li>Analytics</li></ul>
        </div>
      </article>
      <article class="panel">
        <p class="pword" aria-hidden="true">Scale</p>
        <div class="pbody">
          <h2>Business process &amp; industrial solutions</h2>
          <p>End-to-end BPO and operational support &mdash; supply-chain workflows on SAP, e-commerce and web builds, plus environmental and industrial systems (STP, ETP, chemical machinery, monitoring instrumentation). Clean processes, a healthier operation.</p>
          <ul class="tags">
            <li>BPO</li>
            <li>SAP / SCM</li>
            <li>E-commerce</li>
            <li>Web design</li>
            <li>STP / ETP</li>
            <li>Instrumentation</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </article>
      <article class="panel">
        <p class="pword" aria-hidden="true">Care</p>
        <div class="pbody">
          <h2>Healthcare support services</h2>
          <p>Accurate, compliant back-office support for healthcare providers &mdash; including US medical billing, claims preparation and revenue-cycle workflows, handled by a trained team with documented quality checks at every step.</p>
          <ul class="tags">
            <li>US medical billing</li>
            <li>Claims support</li>
            <li>Revenue cycle</li>
            <li>Compliance-aware QA</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style is:global>
  .pin-head {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 3;
    padding: calc(var(--nav) + 12px) var(--gx) 0;
    font: 700 1rem var(--disp);
  }
  .dots {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 3;
    display: none;
    gap: 10px;
    padding: 10px var(--gx) 0;
    font-size: 13px;
  }
  .dot {
    padding: 5px 14px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(244, 240, 232, .3);
    border-radius: 999px;
    opacity: .55;
    transition: all .4s;
  }
  .dot.is-on {
    background: var(--ivory);
    color: var(--teal);
    opacity: 1;
    border-color: var(--ivory);
  }
  .panel {
    position: relative;
    padding: 48px var(--gx);
  }
  .pword {
    font: 800 clamp(5.5rem, 22vw, 24rem)/.82 var(--disp);
    letter-spacing: -.05em;
    color: transparent;
    -webkit-text-stroke: 1.5px rgba(244, 240, 232, .3);
  }
  .pbody {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    max-width: 560px;
    margin-top: 24px;
  }
  .pbody h2 {
    font: 700 clamp(1.9rem, 3.6vw, 3.2rem)/1.05 var(--disp);
    letter-spacing: -.03em;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }
  .pbody p {
    opacity: .78;
  }
  .tags {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 8px;
    margin-top: 22px;
  }
  .tags li {
    padding: 6px 14px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(244, 240, 232, .3);
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-size: 13px;
  }
  .services.is-pin {
    height: 520svh;
    overscroll-behavior: contain;
  }
  .is-pin .pin {
    position: sticky;
    top: 0;
    height: 100svh;
    overflow: hidden;
    z-index: 1;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }
  .is-pin .dots {
    display: flex;
  }
  @property --track {
    syntax: "<number>";
    inherits: false;
    initial-value: 0;
  }
  .is-pin .track {
    display: flex;
    flex: 1 1 auto;
    min-height: 0;
    width: 500vw;
    transform: translate3d(calc(var(--track) * -20%), 0, 0);
    will-change: transform;
  }
  .is-pin .panel {
    flex: 0 0 100vw;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: flex-end;
    padding-bottom: 9vh;
  }
  .is-pin .pword {
    position: absolute;
    left: var(--gx);
    top: 15vh;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .is-pin .panel:nth-child(4) .pword,
  .is-pin .panel:nth-child(5) .pword {
    font-size: clamp(7rem, 26vw, 28rem);
  }
  .services:not(.is-pin) .pin-head {
    padding-top: 56px;
  }
  .services:not(.is-pin) .panel + .panel {
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(244, 240, 232, .14);
  }

  @media (max-width: 899px) {
    .pword {
      font-size: clamp(4rem, 18vw, 7rem);
      -webkit-text-stroke-width: 1.1px;
      letter-spacing: -.045em;
      line-height: .9;
    }
    .services:not(.is-pin) .pin-head {
      padding-top: calc(var(--nav) + 20px);
      font-size: 1.05rem;
    }
    .services:not(.is-pin) .panel {
      padding-block: clamp(40px, 8vw, 64px);
    }
    .pbody {
      margin-top: 16px;
    }
    .pbody h2 {
      font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 5.4vw, 2.4rem);
    }
    .pbody p {
      font-size: .98rem;
    }
    .tags li {
      font-size: 12px;
      padding: 5px 12px;
    }
  }
</style>
